<title>CANADA: Canada Beef Export Federation details 1996 exports.</title>
<headline>Canada Beef Export Federation details 1996 exports.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canada Beef Export Federation on Tuesday detailed its export volumes to key markets in metric tonnes.</p>
<p>		   Export Volumes to Targeted Markets</p>
<p>Country/Region 1996	     1995</p>
<p>Japan	    14,226 tonnes  11,686 tonnes</p>
<p>South Korea     4,456	    3,981</p>
<p>Taiwan		831		834</p>
<p>Hong Kong	 1,664		675</p>
<p>China (PRC)	 923	    1,009</p>
<p>S.E. Asia	   639		515</p>
<p>Mexico	    3,099	    2,998</p>
<p>TOTAL	    25,838	   21,698</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
